  "details": "When using an Xbox (or other) controller on Desktop, add an option for the joystick or D-pad to snap discretely between UI buttons rather than acting as a free cursor. This would make navigating menus (such as the Menus and keyboard Menu) feel more natural for gamepad users, as the cursor mode makes it hard to navigate.\n\nSidenote: would also be nice to have a sensitivity setting, current sensitivity is quite slow",
